  "prefLabel": "Occ 401.03 Supervision",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Occ 401.03 \"Supervision\" means a cooperative process in which 2 or more people participate in a joint effort to establish, maintain, or elevate a level of competence and performance.\n\nSource. #8896, eff 6-7-07; ss and renumbered by #10902, eff 7-29-15 (from Occ 401.06); ss by #14478, eff 3-13-26, EXPIRES: 3-13-36 (formerly Occ 401.07)",
